    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100,000 words of engaging storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three captivating love interests: Hannah, Liz, and Marlon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus triad ending featuring both Liz and Marlon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional one-night stand with Donna, your boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic endings that adapt to your choices throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/db824d103fa780f7ae33197b26bd459f.avif?t=1742910151\" width=448 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christine's Care is a slice-of-life yuri visual novel set in early 2000s Canada. After a painful breakup with her boyfriend, Christine moves to a big city and takes on a new role as a nurse. She is assigned to care for Hannah, a woman her own age who is paralyzed from the waist down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/31e0fa9bc964f02710b72d4dc36efdd8.avif?t=1742910151\" width=559 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christine is immediately struck by Hannah\u2019s complexity\u2014intelligent, beautiful, yet deeply bitter about her condition. As the story unfolds, the two women grow closer, forging a connection that might transform both of their lives. Will Christine be the one to help Hannah find new hope, or will Hannah end up changing Christine in ways she never expected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/20163ccad09e4dfde01bfdac359f22d1.avif?t=1742910151\" width=711 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Christine encounters an unusual couple: Marlon, a muscular Latina with a commanding presence, and Liz, a delicate, half-Asian woman in a submissive role. Their dominant/submissive relationship is unlike anything Christine has experienced, but she quickly becomes fascinated by their dynamic. One day, Marlon invites her to take control and dominate Liz, an offer that Christine unexpectedly enjoys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/657872b3473a82ce26f844202569d90e.avif?t=1742910151\" width=274 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last but not least, Donna, Christine's boss, is grappling with marital troubles. Suspecting her husband of infidelity, she finds herself on shaky ground. Will Christine step in to support her, offering a helping hand\u2014and perhaps a shoulder to lean on when she needs it most?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100,000 words of engaging storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three captivating love interests: Hannah, Liz, and Marlon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus triad ending featuring both Liz and Marlon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional one-night stand with Donna, your boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic endings that adapt to your choices throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/db824d103fa780f7ae33197b26bd459f.avif?t=1742910151\" width=448 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christine's Care is a slice-of-life yuri visual novel set in early 2000s Canada. After a painful breakup with her boyfriend, Christine moves to a big city and takes on a new role as a nurse. She is assigned to care for Hannah, a woman her own age who is paralyzed from the waist down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/31e0fa9bc964f02710b72d4dc36efdd8.avif?t=1742910151\" width=559 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christine is immediately struck by Hannah\u2019s complexity\u2014intelligent, beautiful, yet deeply bitter about her condition. As the story unfolds, the two women grow closer, forging a connection that might transform both of their lives. Will Christine be the one to help Hannah find new hope, or will Hannah end up changing Christine in ways she never expected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/20163ccad09e4dfde01bfdac359f22d1.avif?t=1742910151\" width=711 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Christine encounters an unusual couple: Marlon, a muscular Latina with a commanding presence, and Liz, a delicate, half-Asian woman in a submissive role. Their dominant/submissive relationship is unlike anything Christine has experienced, but she quickly becomes fascinated by their dynamic. One day, Marlon invites her to take control and dominate Liz, an offer that Christine unexpectedly enjoys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317630/extras/657872b3473a82ce26f844202569d90e.avif?t=1742910151\" width=274 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last but not least, Donna, Christine's boss, is grappling with marital troubles. Suspecting her husband of infidelity, she finds herself on shaky ground. Will Christine step in to support her, offering a helping hand\u2014and perhaps a shoulder to lean on when she needs it most?</p>",
